# AI-context artifacts — a LOCAL CACHE, deliberately not committed.
# Every one of these is derived from the code, so a committed copy is a second
# answer to a question the code already answers: the one that drifts. Nothing in
# git means nothing to drift from — no drift gate, no hook staging generated
# output, no index diff on every commit. Rebuild: `npm run ai:refresh`
# (also run by `postinstall`, so a fresh clone and CI have working MCP lookups).
# Sources stay committed: docs/decisions/, docs/lessons/, docs/examples/,
# docs/PRODUCT.md and the hand-written docs/*.md.
docs/AI_CAPABILITIES.md
docs/AI_PROJECT_INDEX.md
docs/AI_DECISIONS_INDEX.md
docs/AI_LESSONS_INDEX.md
docs/AI_EXAMPLES_INDEX.md
